{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-10-06 10:00:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE CHANGES HEADQUARTERS TO WESTMINSTER, COLORADO', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE CAMPUS NAMED SILICON VALLEY CENTER FOR INNOVATION AND OPERATIONS WESTMINSTER, COLO. , OCT. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY HAS CHANGED ITS HEADQUARTERS FROM SUNNYVALE, CALIFORNIA TO WESTMINSTER, COLORADO.'}